<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<device xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" schemaVersion="1.3" xs:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="CMSIS-SVD.xsd">
  <vendor>Mu3e</vendor>
  <vendorID>MU3E</vendorID>
  <name>MU3E_FULL8LANE_TYPE0_SYSTEM_SC_HUB</name>
  <series>MU3E_FULL8LANE_TYPE0</series>
  <version>2026.05.06</version>
  <description>Grouped CMSIS-SVD for the current full8lane type0 Qsys system. Every peripheral baseAddress is an offset in the SC-hub command address space, i.e. downstream of sc_hub.hub/sc_hub_cmd_pipe.m0. The datapath-local AUTO_AVMM map is expanded below mm_bridge.s0 at 0x00020000, and the upload AUTO_UPLOAD_AVMM map is expanded below upload_mm_bridge.s0 at 0x00030000. The JTAG-side sc_hub.csr aperture is intentionally not listed because it is upstream of the SC-hub command address space. The direct LVDS debug/JTAG master aperture from build_full8lane_system.tcl is not used for these baseAddress values; the SC-hub LVDS CSR base is the datapath-local 0x9000 plus the mm_bridge.s0 base. Run-control note: build Tcl runctl_mgmt_host_readyless_version=26.3.0.505; generated HTML runctl_mgmt_host=26.2.6.425.</description>
  <addressUnitBits>8</addressUnitBits>
  <width>32</width>
  <size>32</size>
  <access>read-write</access>
  <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
  <resetMask>0xFFFFFFFF</resetMask>
  <peripherals>
    <peripheral>
      <name>SCRATCH_PAD_RAM_S1</name>
      <description>Direct control-path slave reached from sc_hub_cmd_pipe.m0. Qsys slave scratch_pad_ram.s1 is SC-hub-relative at 0x00000000 with compiled aperture size 0x00000400. Compiled Qsys module scratch_pad_ram kind=altera_avalon_onchip_memory2 version=18.1 from full8lane_control_path_subsystem.qsys. Source SVD toolkits/infra/cmsis_svd/generic/scratch_pad_ram.svd version 1.0.0. Relative 256-word read/write scratchpad aperture.</description>
      <groupName>CONTROL_PATH</groupName>
      <baseAddress>0x00000000</baseAddress>
