      <description>Direct control-path slave reached from sc_hub_cmd_pipe.m0. Qsys slave max10_prog_avmm_0.csr_avmm is SC-hub-relative at 0x00012000 with compiled aperture size 0x00001000. Compiled Qsys module max10_prog_avmm_0 kind=max10_prog_avmm version=0.2.0 from full8lane_control_path_subsystem.qsys. Version/identity parameters: VERSION_MAJOR=0, VERSION_MINOR=2, VERSION_PATCH=0, BUILD=0. Source SVD feb_max10_comm/legacy/max10_prog_avmm/max10_prog_avmm.svd version 0.2.0. Relative CSR aperture for standard-AVMM MAX10 page programming. The sparse gaps between LAST_ERROR and PAGE_DATA are reserved.</description>
