      <description>Direct control-path slave reached from sc_hub_cmd_pipe.m0. Qsys slave charge_injection_pulser_0.csr_avmm is SC-hub-relative at 0x00013000 with compiled aperture size 0x00000004. Compiled Qsys module charge_injection_pulser_0 kind=charge_injection_pulser version=4.0.5 from full8lane_control_path_subsystem.qsys. Source SVD charge_injection/legacy/charge_injection_pulser.svd version 4.0.5. Single-word write-only CSR aperture for charge-injection pulse generation.</description>
