      <name>MUTRIG_CFG_CTRL_0_AVMM_CSR</name>
      <description>Direct control-path slave reached from sc_hub_cmd_pipe.m0. Qsys slave mutrig_cfg_ctrl_0.avmm_csr is SC-hub-relative at 0x0003F010 with compiled aperture size 0x00000010. Compiled Qsys module mutrig_cfg_ctrl_0 kind=mutrig_cfg_ctrl version=24.1.423 from full8lane_control_path_subsystem.qsys. Source SVD mutrig_controller/mutrig_cfg_ctrl.svd version 24.0.817. Relative 4-word command/status aperture for the MuTRiG controller.</description>
